Distribution deviation from kubeflow/katib v0.19.0 for the Katib MySQL Deployment.

scripts/synchronize-katib-manifests.sh applies this patch to the freshly
imported applications/katib/upstream/components/mysql/mysql.yaml. It records
the edits that the distribution made to that imported file:
  8516895e align GHA tests to KF/MR (#3307): image mysql:8.0, probes through
           127.0.0.1, liveness probe as a query, startupProbe removed
  854bd3a2 Update mysql.yaml (#3310): variable syntax of the liveness command

The script checks the SHA-256 of the imported file before and of the result
after the application. When upstream changes the file, review this patch, then
update it together with both digests in the script.

diff --git a/applications/katib/upstream/components/mysql/mysql.yaml b/applications/katib/upstream/components/mysql/mysql.yaml
index e948b45d..1dbd3d4e 100644
--- a/applications/katib/upstream/components/mysql/mysql.yaml
+++ b/applications/katib/upstream/components/mysql/mysql.yaml
@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@ spec:
         fsGroupChangePolicy: OnRootMismatch
       containers:
         - name: katib-mysql
-          image: mysql:8.0.29
+          image: mysql:8.0
           args:
             - --datadir
             - /var/lib/mysql/datadir
@@ -46,27 +46,19 @@ spec:
               command:
                 - "/bin/bash"
                 - "-c"
-                - "mysql -D ${MYSQL_DATABASE} -u root -p${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD} -e 'SELECT 1'"
+                - "mysql -h 127.0.0.1 -D ${MYSQL_DATABASE} -u root -p${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD} -e 'SELECT 1'"
             initialDelaySeconds: 10
             periodSeconds: 5
             failureThreshold: 10
           livenessProbe:
             exec:
               command:
-                - "/bin/bash"
-                - "-c"
-                - "mysqladmin ping -u root -p${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD}"
+              - "/bin/bash"
+              - "-c"
+              - "mysql -h 127.0.0.1 -D ${MYSQL_DATABASE} -u root -p${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD} -e 'SELECT 1'"
             initialDelaySeconds: 10
             periodSeconds: 5
             failureThreshold: 10
-          startupProbe:
-            exec:
-              command:
-                - "/bin/bash"
-                - "-c"
-                - "mysqladmin ping -u root -p${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD}"
-            periodSeconds: 15
-            failureThreshold: 60
           volumeMounts:
             - name: katib-mysql
               mountPath: /var/lib/mysql
